    <item>
      <title>AI双刃剑：电商信任危机与真实性消弭下的数字迷宫</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/article-20251208084004912-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 08 Dec 2025 08:40:04 +0800</pubDate>
